  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Develop and Strengthen Fiscal and Subnational Services Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo y Fortalecimiento de la Gestin Fiscal y de Servicios Subnacionales</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo para la segunda operacin de la CCLIP es mejorar la gestin fiscal y de la inversin pblica de los GD. Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo son: (i) fortalecer la gestin financiera contable departamental; (ii) mejorar la eficiencia de la gestin de servicios pblicos a travs de su digitalizacin; y (iii) facilitar el acceso a infraestructura pblica sostenible e inclusiva.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective for the second operation of the CCLIP is to improve the fiscal and public investment management of the DGs. The specific development objectives are: (i) strengthen departmental accounting-financial management; (ii) improve the efficiency of public service management through digitalization; and (iii) facilitate access to sustainable and inclusive public infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
